#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:4
msgid "MaxStorage"
msgstr "MaxStorage"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:6
msgid ""
"MaxCompute MaxStorage 是 MaxCompute 提供的高吞吐数据读写接口。相比于基于 "
"Tunnel 的数据通道， MaxStorage 提供了更细粒度的会话管理、支持 Arrow 格式"
"和 Blob 格式读写、支持增量读取以及表预览等功能， 适用于大规模并行数据读写"
"场景。"
msgstr ""
"MaxCompute MaxStorage is a high-throughput data read/write interface "
"provided by MaxCompute. Compared to the Tunnel-based data channel, "
"MaxStorage offers finer-grained session management, supports Arrow and "
"Blob format read/write, incremental reads, and table preview, making it "
"suitable for large-scale parallel data read/write scenarios."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:12
msgid "MaxStorage 需要服务端支持，请确保 MaxCompute 集群已开启相关功能。"
msgstr ""
"MaxStorage requires server-side support. Make sure the relevant features "
"are enabled on your MaxCompute cluster."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:15
msgid "基本概念"
msgstr "Core concepts"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:17
msgid "MaxStorage 的核心概念包括："
msgstr "The core concepts of MaxStorage include:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:19
msgid ""
"**会话（Session）**：读写操作的事务上下文。读会话管理数据分片，写会话"
"保证数据原子性。"
msgstr ""
"**Session**: The transactional context for read/write operations. A read "
"session manages data splits; a write session guarantees data atomicity."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:20
msgid ""
"**分片（Split）**：读会话将数据按大小、并行度等方式分为多个分片，每个分片"
"可独立读取，支持并行处理。"
msgstr ""
"**Split**: A read session divides data into multiple splits by size, "
"parallelism, etc. Each split can be read independently, enabling parallel"
" processing."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:21
msgid ""
"**流（Stream）**：写会话中的数据上传通道。一个写会话可创建多个流以支持"
"并行写入。"
msgstr ""
"**Stream**: A data upload channel within a write session. A write session"
" can create multiple streams to support parallel writes."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:22
msgid ""
"**压缩（Compression）**：读路径支持 UNCOMPRESSED（默认）、LZ4 和 ZSTD "
"压缩算法，写路径通过 Arrow IPC 内置压缩实现，减少网络传输数据量。"
msgstr ""
"**Compression**: The read path supports UNCOMPRESSED (default), LZ4, and "
"ZSTD; the write path uses Arrow IPC built-in compression, reducing "
"network transfer size."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:23
msgid ""
"**路由令牌（Route Token）**：服务端返回的路由标识，用于会话亲和性，确保"
"后续请求路由到同一节点。"
msgstr ""
"**Route Token**: A routing identifier returned by the server, used for "
"session affinity to ensure subsequent requests are routed to the same "
"node."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Exactly-Once 模式**：写流支持精确一次语义，通过 access_token 和 row_"
"offset 实现幂等写入。"
msgstr ""
"**Exactly-Once Mode**: Write streams support exactly-once semantics, "
"achieving idempotent writes via access_token and row_offset."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:25
msgid ""
"**API 版本**：``api_version`` 参数（默认 ``\"2\"``）选择 URL 路径 ``api/"
"storage/v2`` 或 ``api/storage/v3``，v3 特性通过 ``_supports_v3()`` 门控。"
msgstr ""
"**API Version**: The ``api_version`` parameter (default ``\"2\"``) "
"selects the URL path ``api/storage/v2`` or ``api/storage/v3``; v3-era "
"features are gated behind ``_supports_v3()``."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:28
msgid "客户端初始化"
msgstr "Client initialization"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:30
msgid "使用 MaxStorage 需要创建 ``MaxStorageClient`` 实例，传入 ODPS 入口对象。"
msgstr ""
"To use MaxStorage, create a ``MaxStorageClient`` instance, passing in the"
" ODPS entry object."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:32
msgid ""
"from odps import ODPS\n"
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient\n"
"\n"
"# 初始化 ODPS 入口对象\n"
"odps = ODPS(\n"
"    access_id=\"your_access_id\",\n"
"    secret_access_key=\"your_secret_access_key\",\n"
"    project=\"your_project\",\n"
"    endpoint=\"your_endpoint\",\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 创建 MaxStorage 客户端，默认 api_version=\"2\"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"\n"
"# 使用 API v3（开启 WriteMode、嵌套 Blob 等高级特性）\n"
"client_v3 = MaxStorageClient(odps, api_version=\"3\")"
msgstr ""
"from odps import ODPS\n"
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient\n"
"\n"
"# Initialize the ODPS entry object\n"
"odps = ODPS(\n"
"    access_id=\"your_access_id\",\n"
"    secret_access_key=\"your_secret_access_key\",\n"
"    project=\"your_project\",\n"
"    endpoint=\"your_endpoint\",\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# Create a MaxStorage client; default api_version=\"2\"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"\n"
"# Use API v3 (enables WriteMode, nested Blob, and other advanced "
"features)\n"
"client_v3 = MaxStorageClient(odps, api_version=\"3\")"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:51
msgid "也可以通过 ``tunnel_endpoint`` 参数手动指定 Tunnel 端点，绕过自动发现："
msgstr ""
"You can also manually specify the tunnel endpoint via the "
"``tunnel_endpoint`` parameter, bypassing auto-discovery:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:53
msgid ""
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps, tunnel_endpoint=\"http://your-tunnel-"
"endpoint\")"
msgstr ""
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps, tunnel_endpoint=\"http://your-tunnel-"
"endpoint\")"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:57
msgid "还可以通过 ``quota_name`` 参数指定资源配额："
msgstr "You can also specify a resource quota via the ``quota_name`` parameter:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:59
msgid "client = MaxStorageClient(odps, quota_name=\"your_quota\")"
msgstr "client = MaxStorageClient(odps, quota_name=\"your_quota\")"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:64
msgid "读取数据"
msgstr "Reading data"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:67
msgid "完整读取流程"
msgstr "Complete read flow"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:69
msgid "使用 MaxStorage 读取数据需要以下步骤："
msgstr "Reading data with MaxStorage requires the following steps:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:71 ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:76
msgid "创建读会话"
msgstr "Create a read session"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:72
msgid "按分片读取数据"
msgstr "Read data split by split"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:73
msgid "关闭读会话（会话会自动过期，无需手动关闭）"
msgstr ""
"Close the read session (sessions expire automatically; manual close is "
"optional)"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:78
msgid ""
"通过 :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.MaxStorageClient.create_table_read_session` "
"方法创建读会话。 读会话确定了数据的分片方式、返回的列和分区等。创建后会"
"轮询直到会话状态变为 ``NORMAL``。"
msgstr ""
"Create a read session via "
":meth:`~odps.maxstorage.MaxStorageClient.create_table_read_session`. The "
"session determines the split strategy, returned columns, and partitions. "
"After creation it polls until the session status becomes ``NORMAL``."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:81
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient, SplitOptions, SplitMode\n"
"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"\n"
"# 创建读会话，使用默认分片选项（按大小分片）\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"print(f\"Session ID: {read_session.id}\")\n"
"print(f\"数据分片数: {len(read_session.splits)}\")\n"
"print(f\"总记录数: {read_session.record_count}\")\n"
"print(f\"过期时间: {read_session.expiration_time}\")"
msgstr ""
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient, SplitOptions, SplitMode\n"
"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"\n"
"# Create a read session with default split options (split by size)\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"print(f\"Session ID: {read_session.id}\")\n"
"print(f\"Number of splits: {len(read_session.splits)}\")\n"
"print(f\"Total record count: {read_session.record_count}\")\n"
"print(f\"Expiration time: {read_session.expiration_time}\")"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:94
msgid "创建读会话时可以指定需要读取的列、分区和分片选项："
msgstr ""
"When creating a read session you can specify columns, partitions, and "
"split options:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:96
msgid ""
"# 仅读取指定列和分区\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\n"
"    \"your_table\",\n"
"    columns=[\"id\", \"name\", \"value\"],\n"
"    partitions=[\"pt=20230101\"],\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 按行偏移分片，每个分片 100 万行\n"
"split_opts = SplitOptions(\n"
"    split_mode=SplitMode.ROW_OFFSET,\n"
"    split_number=1000000,\n"
")\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\n"
"    \"your_table\",\n"
"    split_options=split_opts,\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"# Read only specific columns and partitions\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\n"
"    \"your_table\",\n"
"    columns=[\"id\", \"name\", \"value\"],\n"
"    partitions=[\"pt=20230101\"],\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# Split by row offset, 1 million rows per split\n"
"split_opts = SplitOptions(\n"
"    split_mode=SplitMode.ROW_OFFSET,\n"
"    split_number=1000000,\n"
")\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\n"
"    \"your_table\",\n"
"    split_options=split_opts,\n"
")"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:117
msgid ""
"``read_session.splits`` 返回的分片类型取决于 ``SplitMode``： ``SplitMode."
"SIZE`` 下为 :class:`~odps.maxstorage.IndexedInputSplit`（按索引寻址）， `"
"`SplitMode.ROW_OFFSET`` 下为 :class:`~odps.maxstorage.RowRangeInputSplit`"
"（按行偏移区间寻址）。 两者均可直接传给 :meth:`~odps.maxstorage."
"TableReadSession.open_arrow_reader`。"
msgstr ""
"The split type returned by ``read_session.splits`` depends on the "
"``SplitMode``: under ``SplitMode.SIZE`` it is "
":class:`~odps.maxstorage.IndexedInputSplit` (addressed by index), and "
"under ``SplitMode.ROW_OFFSET`` it is "
":class:`~odps.maxstorage.RowRangeInputSplit` (addressed by row-offset "
"range).  Both can be passed directly to "
":meth:`~odps.maxstorage.TableReadSession.open_arrow_reader`."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:124
msgid "对于 append2.0 / 事务表，服务端仅支持 ``SplitMode.ROW_OFFSET`` 分片模式。"
msgstr ""
"For append2.0 / transactional tables, the server only supports the "
"``SplitMode.ROW_OFFSET`` split mode."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:127
msgid "使用 Arrow 格式读取数据"
msgstr "Reading data in Arrow format"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:129
msgid ""
"通过 :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.TableReadSession.open_arrow_reader` 方法可以"
"直接读取为 Arrow RecordBatch："
msgstr ""
"Use :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.TableReadSession.open_arrow_reader` to read "
"directly as Arrow RecordBatches:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:131
msgid ""
"import pyarrow as pa\n"
"\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"\n"
"# 遍历所有分片读取数据\n"
"for split in read_session.splits:\n"
"    reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(split)\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        batch = reader.read()\n"
"        if batch is None:\n"
"            break\n"
"        df = batch.to_pandas()\n"
"        # 处理 DataFrame\n"
"    reader.close()"
msgstr ""
"import pyarrow as pa\n"
"\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"\n"
"# Iterate over all splits to read data\n"
"for split in read_session.splits:\n"
"    reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(split)\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        batch = reader.read()\n"
"        if batch is None:\n"
"            break\n"
"        df = batch.to_pandas()\n"
"        # Process the DataFrame\n"
"    reader.close()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:148
msgid ""
"读取时可以通过 ``max_batch_rows`` 控制每个批次的行数，通过 ``skip_row_num"
"`` 跳过指定行数："
msgstr ""
"You can control the rows per batch with ``max_batch_rows`` and skip rows "
"with ``skip_row_num``:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:150
msgid ""
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(\n"
"    read_session.splits[0],\n"
"    max_batch_rows=1024,\n"
"    skip_row_num=100,\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(\n"
"    read_session.splits[0],\n"
"    max_batch_rows=1024,\n"
"    skip_row_num=100,\n"
")"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:158
msgid ""
"也可以通过 ``get_as_record_reader()`` 获取行形式的 :class:`~odps.models."
"Record` 迭代器。 返回的 :class:`~odps.maxstorage.ArrowRecordReader` 除了"
"迭代外，还暴露以下属性："
msgstr ""
"You can also use ``get_as_record_reader()`` to get a row-oriented "
"iterator of :class:`~odps.models.Record`.  The returned "
":class:`~odps.maxstorage.ArrowRecordReader` exposes the following "
"attributes in addition to iteration:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:161
msgid "``schema``：返回 :class:`~odps.types.OdpsSchema`，包含列名与类型信息。"
msgstr ""
"``schema``: returns an :class:`~odps.types.OdpsSchema` with column names "
"and types."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:162
msgid "``count``：返回已读取的记录数，迭代结束后等于该分片的总行数。"
msgstr ""
"``count``: returns the number of records read so far; after iteration "
"completes it equals the total row count of the split."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:164
msgid ""
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(read_session.splits[0])\n"
"rr = reader.get_as_record_reader()\n"
"print(rr.schema.columns)  # 列信息\n"
"for record in rr:\n"
"    print(record[0], record[1])\n"
"print(rr.count)           # 已读取的记录数"
msgstr ""
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(read_session.splits[0])\n"
"rr = reader.get_as_record_reader()\n"
"print(rr.schema.columns)  # column info\n"
"for record in rr:\n"
"    print(record[0], record[1])\n"
"print(rr.count)           # number of records read"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:174
msgid "并行读取数据"
msgstr "Parallel reads"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:176
msgid ""
"MaxStorage 的分片机制天然支持并行读取。每个分片可以独立读取，适合多线程"
"场景："
msgstr ""
"MaxStorage's split mechanism natively supports parallel reads. Each split"
" can be read independently, making it suitable for multi-threaded "
"scenarios:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:178
msgid ""
"from concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor\n"
"\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"\n"
"def read_split(split):\n"
"    reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(split)\n"
"    batches = []\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        batch = reader.read()\n"
"        if batch is None:\n"
"            break\n"
"        batches.append(batch)\n"
"    reader.close()\n"
"    return pa.concat_batches(batches) if batches else None\n"
"\n"
"# 使用线程池并行读取所有分片\n"
"with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=len(read_session.splits)) as pool:\n"
"    futures = [pool.submit(read_split, s) for s in read_session.splits]\n"
"    results = [f.result() for f in futures]"
msgstr ""
"from concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor\n"
"\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"\n"
"def read_split(split):\n"
"    reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(split)\n"
"    batches = []\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        batch = reader.read()\n"
"        if batch is None:\n"
"            break\n"
"        batches.append(batch)\n"
"    reader.close()\n"
"    return pa.concat_batches(batches) if batches else None\n"
"\n"
"# Read all splits in parallel using a thread pool\n"
"with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=len(read_session.splits)) as pool:\n"
"    futures = [pool.submit(read_split, s) for s in read_session.splits]\n"
"    results = [f.result() for f in futures]"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:201
msgid "增量读取"
msgstr "Incremental reads"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:203
msgid "增量读取用于只读取自某个版本以来新增或变更的数据："
msgstr ""
"Incremental reads retrieve only data added or changed since a given "
"version:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:205
msgid ""
"from odps.maxstorage import IncrementalReadOptions\n"
"\n"
"incr_opts = IncrementalReadOptions(\n"
"    version=\"v1\",\n"
"    from_=100,\n"
"    to=200,\n"
")\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\n"
"    \"your_table\",\n"
"    incremental_read_enabled=True,\n"
"    incremental_read_options=incr_opts,\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"from odps.maxstorage import IncrementalReadOptions\n"
"\n"
"incr_opts = IncrementalReadOptions(\n"
"    version=\"v1\",\n"
"    from_=100,\n"
"    to=200,\n"
")\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\n"
"    \"your_table\",\n"
"    incremental_read_enabled=True,\n"
"    incremental_read_options=incr_opts,\n"
")"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:221
msgid "压缩读取"
msgstr "Compressed reads"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:223
msgid ""
"读路径压缩通过 ``compress_option`` 参数启用，默认为不压缩。支持 ZSTD 和 "
"LZ4_FRAME。"
msgstr ""
"Read-path compression is enabled via the ``compress_option`` parameter; "
"the default is uncompressed.  ZSTD and LZ4_FRAME are supported."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:227
msgid "使用压缩前需安装对应的库："
msgstr "Install the corresponding library before using compression:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:229
msgid "**ZSTD**：``pip install zstandard``"
msgstr "**ZSTD**: ``pip install zstandard``"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:230
msgid "**LZ4**：``pip install lz4``"
msgstr "**LZ4**: ``pip install lz4``"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:232
msgid ""
"from odps.tunnel import CompressOption\n"
"\n"
"compress_option = CompressOption(\n"
"    CompressOption.CompressAlgorithm.ODPS_ZSTD,\n"
")\n"
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(\n"
"    read_session.splits[0],\n"
"    compress_option=compress_option,\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"from odps.tunnel import CompressOption\n"
"\n"
"compress_option = CompressOption(\n"
"    CompressOption.CompressAlgorithm.ODPS_ZSTD,\n"
")\n"
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(\n"
"    read_session.splits[0],\n"
"    compress_option=compress_option,\n"
")"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:244
msgid "也可以使用 ``compress_algo`` 简写："
msgstr "You can also use the ``compress_algo`` shorthand:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:246
msgid ""
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(\n"
"    read_session.splits[0],\n"
"    compress_algo=\"zstd\",\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(\n"
"    read_session.splits[0],\n"
"    compress_algo=\"zstd\",\n"
")"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:254
msgid "读取 Instance 结果"
msgstr "Reading instance results"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:256
msgid ""
"通过 :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.MaxStorageClient.create_instance_read_"
"session` 可以读取 SQL Instance 的结果："
msgstr ""
"Use "
":meth:`~odps.maxstorage.MaxStorageClient.create_instance_read_session` to"
" read the results of a SQL instance:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:258
msgid ""
"instance = odps.execute_sql(\"SELECT * FROM your_table LIMIT 100\")\n"
"instance_session = client.create_instance_read_session(instance)\n"
"\n"
"reader = instance_session.open_arrow_reader(offset=0, count=100)\n"
"while True:\n"
"    batch = reader.read()\n"
"    if batch is None:\n"
"        break\n"
"    print(batch.to_pandas())\n"
"reader.close()"
msgstr ""
"instance = odps.execute_sql(\"SELECT * FROM your_table LIMIT 100\")\n"
"instance_session = client.create_instance_read_session(instance)\n"
"\n"
"reader = instance_session.open_arrow_reader(offset=0, count=100)\n"
"while True:\n"
"    batch = reader.read()\n"
"    if batch is None:\n"
"        break\n"
"    print(batch.to_pandas())\n"
"reader.close()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:272
msgid "表预览"
msgstr "Table preview"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:274
msgid ""
"通过 :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.MaxStorageClient.preview_table` 可以快速预览"
"表的前若干行，无需创建读会话："
msgstr ""
"Use :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.MaxStorageClient.preview_table` to quickly "
"preview the first rows of a table without creating a read session:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:276
msgid ""
"reader = client.preview_table(\"your_table\", limit=10)\n"
"while True:\n"
"    batch = reader.read()\n"
"    if batch is None:\n"
"        break\n"
"    print(batch.to_pandas())\n"
"reader.close()"
msgstr ""
"reader = client.preview_table(\"your_table\", limit=10)\n"
"while True:\n"
"    batch = reader.read()\n"
"    if batch is None:\n"
"        break\n"
"    print(batch.to_pandas())\n"
"reader.close()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:287
msgid "写入数据"
msgstr "Writing data"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:290
msgid "完整写入流程"
msgstr "Complete write flow"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:292
msgid "使用 MaxStorage 写入数据需要以下步骤："
msgstr "Writing data with MaxStorage requires the following steps:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:294 ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:300
msgid "创建写会话"
msgstr "Create a write session"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:295
msgid "创建写流"
msgstr "Create a write stream"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:296
msgid "写入数据（批量或记录形式）"
msgstr "Write data (batch or record-oriented)"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:297
msgid "提交会话"
msgstr "Commit the session"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:302
msgid ""
"通过 :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.MaxStorageClient.create_table_write_session`"
" 方法创建写会话："
msgstr ""
"Create a write session via "
":meth:`~odps.maxstorage.MaxStorageClient.create_table_write_session`:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:304
msgid ""
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient, WriteMode\n"
"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"\n"
"# 创建批处理写会话（默认）\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"\n"
"# 创建流式写会话\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\n"
"    \"your_table\",\n"
"    write_mode=WriteMode.STREAMING,\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 写入指定分区\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\n"
"    \"your_table\",\n"
"    partition_spec=\"pt=20230101\",\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient, WriteMode\n"
"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"\n"
"# Create a batch write session (default)\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"\n"
"# Create a streaming write session\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\n"
"    \"your_table\",\n"
"    write_mode=WriteMode.STREAMING,\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# Write to a specific partition\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\n"
"    \"your_table\",\n"
"    partition_spec=\"pt=20230101\",\n"
")"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:326
msgid "批量写入 Arrow RecordBatch"
msgstr "Batch-writing Arrow RecordBatches"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:328
msgid ""
"通过 :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.TableWriteSession.open_arrow_writer` 创建"
"写流，再调用 ``write_batch`` 写入："
msgstr ""
"Create a writer via "
":meth:`~odps.maxstorage.TableWriteSession.open_arrow_writer`, then call "
"``write_batch`` to write:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:330
msgid ""
"import pyarrow as pa\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\")\n"
"\n"
"schema = pa.schema([\n"
"    (\"id\", pa.int64()),\n"
"    (\"name\", pa.string()),\n"
"])\n"
"batch = pa.RecordBatch.from_arrays(\n"
"    [pa.array([1, 2, 3], type=pa.int64()),\n"
"     pa.array([\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"], type=pa.string())],\n"
"    schema=schema,\n"
")\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"
msgstr ""
"import pyarrow as pa\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\")\n"
"\n"
"schema = pa.schema([\n"
"    (\"id\", pa.int64()),\n"
"    (\"name\", pa.string()),\n"
"])\n"
"batch = pa.RecordBatch.from_arrays(\n"
"    [pa.array([1, 2, 3], type=pa.int64()),\n"
"     pa.array([\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"], type=pa.string())],\n"
"    schema=schema,\n"
")\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:351
msgid "异步刷新"
msgstr "Asynchronous flush"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:353
msgid ""
"通过 :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.TableArrowWriter.flush_async` 可以异步刷新"
"缓冲区，配合 ``max_pending_buffers`` 控制背压："
msgstr ""
"Use :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.TableArrowWriter.flush_async` to flush "
"buffers asynchronously, with ``max_pending_buffers`` controlling "
"backpressure:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:355
msgid ""
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\", "
"max_pending_buffers=4)\n"
"for batch in batches:\n"
"    writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"    writer.flush_async()\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"
msgstr ""
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\", "
"max_pending_buffers=4)\n"
"for batch in batches:\n"
"    writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"    writer.flush_async()\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:365
msgid "记录形式写入"
msgstr "Record-oriented writes"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:367
msgid ""
"通过 ``get_as_record_writer()`` 可以使用行形式的 :class:`~odps.models."
"Record` 接口写入， 无需手动构造 Arrow 批次。该方法可用于任意 :class:`"
"TableArrowWriter`（包括普通表和 BLOB 表）。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``get_as_record_writer()`` to write via a row-oriented "
":class:`~odps.models.Record` interface without manually constructing "
"Arrow batches. This method works with any :class:`TableArrowWriter` "
"(plain tables and BLOB tables)."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:371
msgid "**普通表写入**（无 BLOB 列）："
msgstr "**Plain table write** (no BLOB columns):"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:373
msgid ""
"from odps.models import Record\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\")\n"
"record_writer = writer.get_as_record_writer()\n"
"\n"
"record_writer.write(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"name\"], values=[1, "
"\"alice\"]))\n"
"record_writer.write(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"name\"], values=[2, "
"\"bob\"]))\n"
"record_writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"
msgstr ""
"from odps.models import Record\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\")\n"
"record_writer = writer.get_as_record_writer()\n"
"\n"
"record_writer.write(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"name\"], values=[1, "
"\"alice\"]))\n"
"record_writer.write(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"name\"], values=[2, "
"\"bob\"]))\n"
"record_writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:386
msgid "**Delta 表写入**（含 ``__operation`` 列，支持 UPSERT/DELETE）："
msgstr ""
"**Delta table write** (with ``__operation`` column, supports "
"UPSERT/DELETE):"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:388
msgid ""
"from odps.models import Record\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"delta_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\")\n"
"record_writer = writer.get_as_record_writer()  # 返回 "
"DeltaTableRecordWriter\n"
"\n"
"record_writer.write(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"name\"], values=[1, "
"\"alice\"]))  # UPSERT\n"
"record_writer.write(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"name\"], values=[2, "
"\"bob\"]))    # UPSERT\n"
"record_writer.delete(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"name\"], values=[2, "
"None]))    # DELETE\n"
"record_writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"
msgstr ""
"from odps.models import Record\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"delta_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\")\n"
"record_writer = writer.get_as_record_writer()  # returns "
"DeltaTableRecordWriter\n"
"\n"
"record_writer.write(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"name\"], values=[1, "
"\"alice\"]))  # UPSERT\n"
"record_writer.write(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"name\"], values=[2, "
"\"bob\"]))    # UPSERT\n"
"record_writer.delete(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"name\"], values=[2, "
"None]))    # DELETE\n"
"record_writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:404
msgid ""
"``get_as_record_writer()`` 根据 schema 自动选择 writer 类型：若表包含 ``"
"__operation`` 列，返回 ``DeltaTableRecordWriter``，其 ``write()`` 方法 "
"标记 UPSERT、``delete()`` 方法标记 DELETE，两种操作可在同一 writer 实例上"
" 自由交替使用。否则返回 ``AppendTableRecordWriter``。 BLOB 表的 Record "
"API 写入见 :ref:`blob-auto-upload`。"
msgstr ""
"``get_as_record_writer()`` selects the writer type based on the schema: "
"if the table has an ``__operation`` column, it returns ``"
"DeltaTableRecordWriter``, whose ``write()`` method stamps UPSERT and ``"
"delete()`` method stamps DELETE — both operations can be freely "
"interleaved on a single writer instance. Otherwise it returns ``"
"AppendTableRecordWriter``. For Record API writes on BLOB tables, see :ref"
":`blob-auto-upload`."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:411
msgid "压缩写入"
msgstr "Compressed writes"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:413
msgid "写路径通过 Arrow IPC 内置压缩实现，通过 ``compress_option`` 参数启用："
msgstr ""
"The write path uses Arrow IPC built-in compression, enabled via the "
"``compress_option`` parameter:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:415
msgid ""
"from odps.tunnel import CompressOption\n"
"\n"
"compress_option = CompressOption(\n"
"    CompressOption.CompressAlgorithm.ODPS_ZSTD,\n"
")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(\n"
"    stream_id=\"0\",\n"
"    compress_option=compress_option,\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"from odps.tunnel import CompressOption\n"
"\n"
"compress_option = CompressOption(\n"
"    CompressOption.CompressAlgorithm.ODPS_ZSTD,\n"
")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(\n"
"    stream_id=\"0\",\n"
"    compress_option=compress_option,\n"
")"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:428
msgid "提交与终止"
msgstr "Commit and abort"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:430
msgid ""
"写入完成后调用 :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.TableWriteSession.commit` 提交数据"
"。 若需要丢弃数据，调用 :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.TableWriteSession.abort`"
"："
msgstr ""
"After writing, call :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.TableWriteSession.commit` to "
"finalize the data. To discard the data, call "
":meth:`~odps.maxstorage.TableWriteSession.abort`:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:433
msgid ""
"# 提交\n"
"write_session.commit()\n"
"\n"
"# 终止（丢弃所有已上传数据）\n"
"write_session.abort()"
msgstr ""
"# Commit\n"
"write_session.commit()\n"
"\n"
"# Abort (discard all uploaded data)\n"
"write_session.abort()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:443
msgid "``close()`` 不会自动提交：若未显式提交或终止，``close()`` 会自动终止会话。"
msgstr ""
"``close()`` does not auto-commit: if neither commit nor abort was called "
"explicitly, ``close()`` will abort the session."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:446
msgid "跨进程读写"
msgstr "Cross-process read/write"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:448
msgid ""
"MaxStorage 的会话 ID 是服务端分配的全局标识，可以在进程间传递。这使得 \""
"一个进程创建会话、多个进程并行读写\" 的架构成为可能。"
msgstr ""
"The MaxStorage session ID is a server-assigned global identifier that can"
" be passed between processes. This enables an architecture where one "
"process creates the session and multiple processes read and write in "
"parallel."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:452
msgid "跨进程读取"
msgstr "Cross-process read"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:454
msgid ""
"主进程创建读会话，将 ``session_id`` 和分片信息分发给多个工作进程。每个"
"工作 进程通过 ``session_id`` 重载会话，独立读取各自负责的分片："
msgstr ""
"The main process creates a read session and distributes the "
"``session_id`` and split information to worker processes. Each worker "
"reloads the session via ``session_id`` and independently reads its "
"assigned splits:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:457
msgid ""
"# ---- 主进程：创建读会话，分发分片 ----\n"
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient\n"
"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"\n"
"session_id = read_session.id          # 传递给工作进程\n"
"splits = read_session.splits          # 分片列表，每个分片可独立读取\n"
"\n"
"# 将 session_id 和 splits 分发给工作进程（例如通过 multiprocessing.Queue"
"、\n"
"# Redis、文件等）"
msgstr ""
"# ---- Main process: create read session, distribute splits ----\n"
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient\n"
"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"\n"
"session_id = read_session.id          # pass to worker processes\n"
"splits = read_session.splits          # split list, each independently "
"readable\n"
"\n"
"# Distribute session_id and splits to workers (e.g. via "
"multiprocessing.Queue,\n"
"# Redis, files, etc.)"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:472
msgid ""
"# ---- 工作进程：重载会话，读取指定分片 ----\n"
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient\n"
"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"\n"
"# 通过 session_id 重载已有会话（不会创建新会话）\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\"your_table\", "
"session_id=session_id)\n"
"\n"
"# 每个工作进程只读取自己负责的分片\n"
"for split in my_splits:\n"
"    reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(split)\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        batch = reader.read()\n"
"        if batch is None:\n"
"            break\n"
"        process(batch)\n"
"    reader.close()"
msgstr ""
"# ---- Worker process: reload session, read assigned splits ----\n"
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient\n"
"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"\n"
"# Reload the existing session via session_id (does not create a new "
"session)\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\"your_table\", "
"session_id=session_id)\n"
"\n"
"# Each worker reads only its assigned splits\n"
"for split in my_splits:\n"
"    reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(split)\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        batch = reader.read()\n"
"        if batch is None:\n"
"            break\n"
"        process(batch)\n"
"    reader.close()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:493
msgid "跨进程写入"
msgstr "Cross-process write"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:495
msgid ""
"主进程创建写会话，将 ``session_id`` 分发给多个工作进程。每个工作进程通过 "
"``session_id`` 重载会话并以 ``resume=True`` 创建写流，独立写入数据。所有 "
"工作进程完成后，主进程提交会话："
msgstr ""
"The main process creates a write session and distributes the "
"``session_id`` to worker processes. Each worker reloads the session via "
"``session_id``, creates a write stream with ``resume=True``, and writes "
"data independently. Once all workers finish, the main process commits the"
" session:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:499
msgid ""
"# ---- 主进程：创建写会话 ----\n"
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient, WriteMode\n"
"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"session_id = write_session.id          # 传递给工作进程\n"
"\n"
"# 等待所有工作进程完成写入...\n"
"\n"
"# 主进程提交会话（只需 session_id 即可重载并提交）\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\", "
"session_id=session_id)\n"
"write_session.commit()"
msgstr ""
"# ---- Main process: create write session ----\n"
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient, WriteMode\n"
"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"session_id = write_session.id          # pass to worker processes\n"
"\n"
"# Wait for all worker processes to finish writing...\n"
"\n"
"# Main process commits the session (reload via session_id, then commit)\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\", "
"session_id=session_id)\n"
"write_session.commit()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:515
msgid ""
"# ---- 工作进程：重载会话，resume 写入 ----\n"
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient\n"
"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\", "
"session_id=session_id)\n"
"\n"
"# resume=True 调用 getWriteStream 获取已有写流的状态\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=my_stream_id, "
"resume=True)\n"
"\n"
"writer.write_batch(my_batch)\n"
"writer.close()   # 关闭写流（不会提交会话）\n"
"\n"
"# 工作进程只需关闭写流，提交由主进程统一完成"
msgstr ""
"# ---- Worker process: reload session, resume writing ----\n"
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient\n"
"\n"
"client = MaxStorageClient(odps)\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\", "
"session_id=session_id)\n"
"\n"
"# resume=True calls getWriteStream to retrieve the existing stream state\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=my_stream_id, "
"resume=True)\n"
"\n"
"writer.write_batch(my_batch)\n"
"writer.close()   # closes the write stream (does not commit the session)\n"
"\n"
"# Workers only close their streams; the main process commits globally"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:533
msgid ""
"每个工作进程使用不同的 ``stream_id``（\"0\"、\"1\"、\"2\"……）以并行写入"
"同一会话。"
msgstr ""
"Each worker process uses a different ``stream_id`` (\"0\", \"1\", \"2\", "
"...) to write to the same session in parallel."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:534
msgid ""
"工作进程的 ``writer.close()`` 仅关闭写流，不会提交数据。必须由主进程调用 "
"``write_session.commit()`` 才能使数据可见。"
msgstr ""
"A worker's ``writer.close()`` only closes the write stream; it does not "
"commit data. The main process must call ``write_session.commit()`` to "
"make the data visible."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:536
msgid ""
"若工作进程异常退出，主进程可调用 ``write_session.abort()`` 丢弃所有已上传"
"数据。"
msgstr ""
"If a worker process exits abnormally, the main process can call "
"``write_session.abort()`` to discard all uploaded data."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:537
msgid ""
"写会话的 ``session_id`` 重载时会自动获取最新的 ``route_token``，确保请求"
"路由 到正确的服务端节点。"
msgstr ""
"When reloading a write session via ``session_id``, the latest "
"``route_token`` is fetched automatically, ensuring requests are routed to"
" the correct server node."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:541
msgid "Exactly-Once 模式"
msgstr "Exactly-Once mode"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:543
msgid "通过 ``exactly_once_mode=True`` 启用精确一次语义："
msgstr "Enable exactly-once semantics with ``exactly_once_mode=True``:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:545
msgid ""
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(\n"
"    stream_id=\"0\",\n"
"    exactly_once_mode=True,\n"
")\n"
"# 写入时每次 flush 携带当前 row_offset，服务端返回新的 "
"ExactlyOnceRowOffset\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"writer.flush()\n"
"\n"
"# 恢复时通过 get_row_offset() 获取最新偏移\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(\n"
"    stream_id=\"0\",\n"
"    exactly_once_mode=True,\n"
"    resume=True,\n"
")\n"
"offset = writer.get_row_offset()"
msgstr ""
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(\n"
"    stream_id=\"0\",\n"
"    exactly_once_mode=True,\n"
")\n"
"# Each flush carries the current row_offset; the server returns a new "
"ExactlyOnceRowOffset\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"writer.flush()\n"
"\n"
"# On resume, use get_row_offset() to fetch the latest offset\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(\n"
"    stream_id=\"0\",\n"
"    exactly_once_mode=True,\n"
"    resume=True,\n"
")\n"
"offset = writer.get_row_offset()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:564
msgid "Blob 读写"
msgstr "Blob I/O"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:567
msgid "什么是 Blob"
msgstr "What is a Blob"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:569
msgid ""
"**Blob**（Binary Large Object）是 MaxCompute 中用于存储二进制数据的列类型"
"（``BLOB``）， 适用于存储图片、音频、视频、文档等非结构化数据。在 "
"MaxStorage 中，BLOB 列的值在 Arrow 层面以 ``bytes``（或 ``pa.binary()``）"
"表示。"
msgstr ""
"A **Blob** (Binary Large Object) is a MaxCompute column type (``BLOB``) "
"for storing binary data, suitable for images, audio, video, documents, "
"and other unstructured data. In MaxStorage, a BLOB column's value is "
"represented at the Arrow level as ``bytes`` (i.e. ``pa.binary()``)."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:574
msgid "什么是 Blob 引用"
msgstr "What is a blob reference"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:576
msgid ""
"由于单条 Blob 数据可能很大，MaxStorage 不会把原始二进制内容直接内嵌在 "
"Arrow 批次中 写入存储层。而是采用**两阶段写入**："
msgstr ""
"Because a single blob can be large, MaxStorage does not inline raw binary"
" content directly in the Arrow batch when writing to storage. Instead it "
"uses a **two-phase write**:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:579
msgid ""
"**上传 Blob 数据**：通过 ``write_blob_batch`` / ``write_blob_stream`` 将"
"原始二进制 数据上传到服务端的 Blob 存储区，服务端返回一个 **blob 引用**（"
"blob reference）。"
msgstr ""
"**Upload the blob data**: use ``write_blob_batch`` / "
"``write_blob_stream`` to upload the raw binary data to the server's blob "
"storage area; the server returns a **blob reference**."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:581
msgid ""
"**写入引用**：将该 blob 引用作为 ``bytes`` 填入 Arrow 批次中 BLOB 列对应"
"的位置， 随普通数据一起 ``write_batch`` 提交。服务端根据引用还原出实际的"
"二进制内容。"
msgstr ""
"**Write the reference**: place the blob reference as ``bytes`` into the "
"BLOB column's slot in the Arrow batch, then submit it together with the "
"regular data via ``write_batch``. The server resolves the reference back "
"to the actual binary content."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:584
msgid ""
"**blob 引用**是一个不透明的 ``bytes``（或 ``str``）值，由服务端在上传时"
"生成，其内部 编码对客户端不可见。客户端只需将其原样写入 BLOB 列即可，**"
"不要**尝试解码、修改或 拼接引用。读取时，BLOB 列返回的同样是 blob 引用；"
"需要调用 ``BlobManager.read_blobs`` 传入引用才能取回真正的二进制数据。"
msgstr ""
"A **blob reference** is an opaque ``bytes`` (or ``str``) value generated "
"by the server at upload time; its internal encoding is not visible to the"
" client. The client only needs to write it verbatim into the BLOB column "
"— **do not** attempt to decode, modify, or concatenate references. On "
"read, the BLOB column likewise returns blob references; you must call ``"
"BlobManager.read_blobs`` with the references to retrieve the actual "
"binary data."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:589
msgid ""
"简而言之：**BLOB 列里存的是引用，不是原始二进制内容；引用是上传后拿到的 `"
"`bytes``， 用它换回原始数据靠 ``read_blobs``。**"
msgstr ""
"In short: **a BLOB column stores references, not raw binary content; the "
"reference is the ``bytes`` you get back after upload, and you use "
"``read_blobs`` to exchange it for the original data.**"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:592
msgid ""
"MaxStorage 不提供 ``Blob`` 包装类——blob 引用就是原始的 ``bytes``/``str``"
"， 这使得它与 Arrow / pandas 等生态无缝衔接。"
msgstr ""
"MaxStorage does not provide a ``Blob`` wrapper class — blob references "
"are plain ``bytes``/``str``, which makes them integrate seamlessly with "
"the Arrow / pandas ecosystem."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:595
msgid "MaxStorage 提供两种 BLOB 写入模式："
msgstr "MaxStorage provides two BLOB write modes:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:597
msgid ""
"**手动上传**（见下文）：显式调用 ``write_blob_batch`` / ``write_blob_"
"stream`` 上传，拿到引用后自行填入 BLOB 列。适用于需要精确控制上传时机或元"
"数据的场景。"
msgstr ""
"**Manual upload** (see below): explicitly call ``write_blob_batch`` / "
"``write_blob_stream`` to upload, then place the returned references into "
"BLOB columns yourself. Suitable for scenarios requiring precise control "
"over upload timing or metadata."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:599
msgid ""
"**自动上传**（见 :ref:`blob-auto-upload`）：创建 writer 时指定 ``auto_"
"upload_blobs=True``，直接在 BLOB 列传入 ``bytes`` / 文件对象， writer "
"自动上传并替换为引用。适用于无需手动管理引用的场景。"
msgstr ""
"**Auto-upload** (see :ref:`blob-auto-upload`): create the writer with "
"``auto_upload_blobs=True`` and pass raw ``bytes`` / file-like objects "
"directly into BLOB columns; the writer uploads and replaces them with "
"references automatically. Suitable for scenarios where manual reference "
"management is unnecessary."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:604
msgid "手动上传"
msgstr "Manual upload"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:606
msgid ""
"在手动上传模式下，你显式调用 ``write_blob_batch`` / ``write_blob_stream``"
" 上传 BLOB 数据，拿到引用后自行填入 Arrow 批次的 BLOB 列。此模式适用于"
"需要精确 控制上传时机、批量大小或元数据的场景。创建 writer 时无需 ``auto_"
"upload_blobs`` （默认即为普通 writer，BLOB 列接受引用 ``bytes``）。"
msgstr ""
"In manual upload mode, you explicitly call ``write_blob_batch`` / "
"``write_blob_stream`` to upload BLOB data, then place the returned "
"references into the BLOB columns of the Arrow batch yourself. This mode "
"is suitable when you need precise control over upload timing, batch size,"
" or metadata. No ``auto_upload_blobs`` is needed when creating the writer"
" (the default plain writer accepts reference ``bytes`` in BLOB columns)."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:611
msgid ""
"``build_blob_write_item`` 的 ``data`` 参数接受 ``bytes``、``bytearray`` "
"或任意可读的 文件对象（file-like，需实现 ``read``/``seek``/``tell``）。"
"传入文件对象时支持 流式读取，无需预先将大 Blob 全量加载到内存："
msgstr ""
"The ``data`` parameter of ``build_blob_write_item`` accepts ``bytes``, "
"``bytearray``, or any readable file-like object (implementing "
"``read``/``seek``/``tell``). When passing a file-like object, the data is"
" read streamingly without loading the entire Blob into memory:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:615
msgid ""
"from io import BytesIO\n"
"\n"
"# bytes / bytearray —— 直接传入\n"
"item1 = writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"image-bytes\", "
"column_name=\"img\")\n"
"item2 = writer.build_blob_write_item(bytearray(b\"more-bytes\"), "
"column_name=\"img\")\n"
"\n"
"# 文件对象 —— 支持流式读取，避免大 Blob 全量加载\n"
"item3 = writer.build_blob_write_item(open(\"large.jpg\", \"rb\"), "
"column_name=\"img\")\n"
"item4 = writer.build_blob_write_item(BytesIO(b\"in-memory-stream\"), "
"column_name=\"img\")"
msgstr ""
"from io import BytesIO\n"
"\n"
"# bytes / bytearray — pass directly\n"
"item1 = writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"image-bytes\", "
"column_name=\"img\")\n"
"item2 = writer.build_blob_write_item(bytearray(b\"more-bytes\"), "
"column_name=\"img\")\n"
"\n"
"# File-like object — supports streaming reads, avoids loading the full "
"blob\n"
"item3 = writer.build_blob_write_item(open(\"large.jpg\", \"rb\"), "
"column_name=\"img\")\n"
"item4 = writer.build_blob_write_item(BytesIO(b\"in-memory-stream\"), "
"column_name=\"img\")"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:627
msgid ""
"import pyarrow as pa\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\")\n"
"\n"
"# 1. 批量上传 Blob，拿到引用（resp.blob_references 已是 list[bytes]）\n"
"items = [\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"image1-bytes\", column_name=\"img\"),"
"\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"image2-bytes\", column_name=\"img\"),"
"\n"
"]\n"
"resp = writer.write_blob_batch(items)\n"
"refs = resp.blob_references  # list[bytes]\n"
"\n"
"# 2. 将引用写入 BLOB 列，随普通数据一起提交\n"
"batch = pa.RecordBatch.from_arrays(\n"
"    [pa.array([0, 1], pa.int64()), pa.array(refs, pa.binary())],\n"
"    schema=pa.schema([(\"id\", pa.int64()), (\"img\", pa.binary())]),\n"
")\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"
msgstr ""
"import pyarrow as pa\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"your_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\")\n"
"\n"
"# 1. Batch-upload blobs and obtain references (resp.blob_references is "
"already list[bytes])\n"
"items = [\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"image1-bytes\", column_name=\"img\"),"
"\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"image2-bytes\", column_name=\"img\"),"
"\n"
"]\n"
"resp = writer.write_blob_batch(items)\n"
"refs = resp.blob_references  # list[bytes]\n"
"\n"
"# 2. Write the references into the BLOB column, submitted with the "
"regular data\n"
"batch = pa.RecordBatch.from_arrays(\n"
"    [pa.array([0, 1], pa.int64()), pa.array(refs, pa.binary())],\n"
"    schema=pa.schema([(\"id\", pa.int64()), (\"img\", pa.binary())]),\n"
")\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:652
msgid "流式上传单个 Blob："
msgstr "Streaming upload of a single blob:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:654
msgid ""
"import pyarrow as pa\n"
"\n"
"# 1. 流式上传单个 Blob，拿到引用（resp.blob_reference 已是 bytes）\n"
"blob_writer = writer.write_blob_stream(column_name=\"img\")\n"
"with open(\"image.jpg\", \"rb\") as f:\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        chunk = f.read(65536)\n"
"        if not chunk:\n"
"            break\n"
"        blob_writer.write(chunk)\n"
"resp = blob_writer.finish()\n"
"ref = resp.blob_reference  # bytes\n"
"\n"
"# 2. 将引用写入 BLOB 列\n"
"batch = pa.RecordBatch.from_arrays(\n"
"    [pa.array([0], pa.int64()), pa.array([ref], pa.binary())],\n"
"    schema=pa.schema([(\"id\", pa.int64()), (\"img\", pa.binary())]),\n"
")\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"
msgstr ""
"import pyarrow as pa\n"
"\n"
"# 1. Stream-upload a single blob and obtain its reference "
"(resp.blob_reference is already bytes)\n"
"blob_writer = writer.write_blob_stream(column_name=\"img\")\n"
"with open(\"image.jpg\", \"rb\") as f:\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        chunk = f.read(65536)\n"
"        if not chunk:\n"
"            break\n"
"        blob_writer.write(chunk)\n"
"resp = blob_writer.finish()\n"
"ref = resp.blob_reference  # bytes\n"
"\n"
"# 2. Write the reference into the BLOB column\n"
"batch = pa.RecordBatch.from_arrays(\n"
"    [pa.array([0], pa.int64()), pa.array([ref], pa.binary())],\n"
"    schema=pa.schema([(\"id\", pa.int64()), (\"img\", pa.binary())]),\n"
")\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:682
msgid "自动上传"
msgstr "Auto-upload"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:684
msgid ""
"在自动上传模式下，创建 writer 时指定 ``auto_upload_blobs=True``，得到 :"
"class:`TableArrowBlobUploadWriter`。此时 BLOB 列可直接传入 ``bytes`` / "
"文件对象， writer 在 ``write_batch`` 或 ``rw.write()`` 时自动批量上传每个"
" BLOB 单元格并 替换为引用。此模式适用于无需手动管理引用的场景。"
msgstr ""
"In auto-upload mode, create the writer with ``auto_upload_blobs=True`` to"
" get a :class:`TableArrowBlobUploadWriter`. BLOB columns can then accept "
"raw ``bytes`` / file-like objects directly; the writer batch-uploads each"
" BLOB cell and replaces it with a reference during ``write_batch`` or "
"``rw.write()``. This mode is suitable when manual reference management is"
" unnecessary."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:689
msgid "**Arrow API 写入**（顶层 BLOB）："
msgstr "**Arrow API write** (top-level BLOB):"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:691
msgid ""
"import pyarrow as pa\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"blob_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\", "
"auto_upload_blobs=True)\n"
"\n"
"# BLOB 列直接传 bytes，writer 自动上传\n"
"batch = pa.RecordBatch.from_arrays(\n"
"    [pa.array([0, 1], pa.int64()), pa.array([b\"img0\", b\"img1\"], "
"pa.binary())],\n"
"    schema=pa.schema([(\"id\", pa.int64()), (\"img\", pa.binary())]),\n"
")\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"
msgstr ""
"import pyarrow as pa\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"blob_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\", "
"auto_upload_blobs=True)\n"
"\n"
"# Pass bytes directly in the BLOB column; the writer auto-uploads\n"
"batch = pa.RecordBatch.from_arrays(\n"
"    [pa.array([0, 1], pa.int64()), pa.array([b\"img0\", b\"img1\"], "
"pa.binary())],\n"
"    schema=pa.schema([(\"id\", pa.int64()), (\"img\", pa.binary())]),\n"
")\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:707
msgid "**Record API 写入**（无需手动构造 Arrow 批次）："
msgstr "**Record API write** (no manual Arrow batch construction):"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:709
msgid ""
"from io import BytesIO\n"
"from odps.models import Record\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"blob_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\", "
"auto_upload_blobs=True)\n"
"rw = writer.get_as_record_writer()\n"
"\n"
"# BLOB 列传 bytes / BytesIO / 文件对象，writer 自动批量上传\n"
"rw.write(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"img\"], values=[1, b\"raw-bytes\"]))\n"
"rw.write(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"img\"], values=[2, BytesIO(b\"file-"
"like\")]))\n"
"rw.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"
msgstr ""
"from io import BytesIO\n"
"from odps.models import Record\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"blob_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\", "
"auto_upload_blobs=True)\n"
"rw = writer.get_as_record_writer()\n"
"\n"
"# Pass bytes / BytesIO / file-like for the BLOB column; the writer auto "
"batch-uploads\n"
"rw.write(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"img\"], values=[1, b\"raw-bytes\"]))\n"
"rw.write(Record(columns=[\"id\", \"img\"], values=[2, BytesIO(b\"file-"
"like\")]))\n"
"rw.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:724
msgid ""
"传入文件对象时，writer 会读取其全部内容并**立即关闭**该文件句柄，因此调用"
"方无需 手动关闭。"
msgstr ""
"When a file-like object is passed, the writer reads its entire content "
"and **immediately closes** the file handle, so the caller does not need "
"to close it manually."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:727
msgid "**嵌套 BLOB 写入**（``ARRAY<BLOB>``，需 API v3）："
msgstr "**Nested BLOB write** (``ARRAY<BLOB>``, requires API v3):"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:729
msgid ""
"from io import BytesIO\n"
"\n"
"# 嵌套 ARRAY<BLOB> 表：a BIGINT, b ARRAY<BLOB>\n"
"client_v3 = MaxStorageClient(odps, api_version=\"3\")\n"
"write_session = "
"client_v3.create_table_write_session(\"nested_blob_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\", "
"auto_upload_blobs=True)\n"
"rw = writer.get_as_record_writer()\n"
"\n"
"# b 列传 list[bytes]，每个元素自动上传\n"
"rw.write([0, [b\"blob_0_a\", b\"blob_0_b\"]])\n"
"rw.write([1, [BytesIO(b\"blob_1_a\"), b\"blob_1_b\", "
"BytesIO(b\"blob_1_c\")]])\n"
"rw.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"
msgstr ""
"from io import BytesIO\n"
"\n"
"# Nested ARRAY<BLOB> table: a BIGINT, b ARRAY<BLOB>\n"
"client_v3 = MaxStorageClient(odps, api_version=\"3\")\n"
"write_session = "
"client_v3.create_table_write_session(\"nested_blob_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\", "
"auto_upload_blobs=True)\n"
"rw = writer.get_as_record_writer()\n"
"\n"
"# Pass list[bytes] for column b; each element is auto-uploaded\n"
"rw.write([0, [b\"blob_0_a\", b\"blob_0_b\"]])\n"
"rw.write([1, [BytesIO(b\"blob_1_a\"), b\"blob_1_b\", "
"BytesIO(b\"blob_1_c\")]])\n"
"rw.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:748
msgid ""
"``auto_upload_blobs=True`` 时返回 :class:`TableArrowBlobUploadWriter`， "
"否则返回普通 :class:`TableArrowWriter`（BLOB 列必须已包含引用 ``bytes``）"
"。 两种 writer 都支持 ``get_as_record_writer()`` 和手动上传辅助方法 （``"
"build_blob_write_item`` / ``write_blob_stream`` / ``write_blob_batch``）"
"。 传入文件对象（``file-like``）写入 BLOB 时，writer 默认**不会**关闭这些"
"文件句柄； 若需自动关闭，创建 writer 时指定 ``auto_close_files=True``。该"
"选项对 Arrow API（``write_batch``）、手动批量上传（``write_blob_batch``）"
"与 Record API（``get_as_record_writer``）均生效。"
msgstr ""
"With ``auto_upload_blobs=True`` a :class:`TableArrowBlobUploadWriter` is "
"returned; otherwise a plain :class:`TableArrowWriter` is returned (BLOB "
"columns must already contain reference ``bytes``). Both writer types "
"support ``get_as_record_writer()`` and the manual-upload helper methods "
"(``build_blob_write_item`` / ``write_blob_stream`` / "
"``write_blob_batch``). When passing file-like objects into BLOB columns, "
"the writer does **not** close them by default; set "
"``auto_close_files=True`` when creating the writer to close them "
"automatically. This applies to the Arrow API (``write_batch``), manual "
"batch upload (``write_blob_batch``), and the Record API "
"(``get_as_record_writer``)."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:759
msgid "读取 Blob"
msgstr "Reading blobs"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:761
msgid ""
"通过 :meth:`~odps.maxstorage.MaxStorageClient.open_blob_manager` 创建 ``"
"BlobManager``， 再调用 ``read_blobs`` / ``read_blob`` 下载："
msgstr ""
"Create a ``BlobManager`` via "
":meth:`~odps.maxstorage.MaxStorageClient.open_blob_manager`, then call "
"``read_blobs`` / ``read_blob`` to download:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:764
msgid ""
"blob_manager = client.open_blob_manager(\"your_table\")\n"
"\n"
"# 读取多个 Blob，返回 BlobDataIterator\n"
"iterator = blob_manager.read_blobs([ref1, ref2])\n"
"for record in iterator:\n"
"    print(len(record.data))  # record.data 为 bytes\n"
"\n"
"# 流式读取（避免缓冲整个 Blob）\n"
"stream_reader = blob_manager.read_blobs([ref1], stream=True)\n"
"while True:\n"
"    chunk = stream_reader.read(4096)\n"
"    if not chunk:\n"
"        break\n"
"    # 处理 chunk\n"
"\n"
"# 读取单个 Blob，返回 file-like 对象\n"
"fp = blob_manager.read_blob(ref1)\n"
"data = fp.read()"
msgstr ""
"blob_manager = client.open_blob_manager(\"your_table\")\n"
"\n"
"# Read multiple blobs; returns a BlobDataIterator\n"
"iterator = blob_manager.read_blobs([ref1, ref2])\n"
"for record in iterator:\n"
"    print(len(record.data))  # record.data is bytes\n"
"\n"
"# Streaming read (avoids buffering the entire blob)\n"
"stream_reader = blob_manager.read_blobs([ref1], stream=True)\n"
"while True:\n"
"    chunk = stream_reader.read(4096)\n"
"    if not chunk:\n"
"        break\n"
"    # Process the chunk\n"
"\n"
"# Read a single blob; returns a file-like object\n"
"fp = blob_manager.read_blob(ref1)\n"
"data = fp.read()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:785
msgid "通过 Record API 读取时，BLOB 列返回引用，需 ``BlobManager`` 下载："
msgstr ""
"When reading via the Record API, BLOB columns return references that must"
" be downloaded via ``BlobManager``:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:787
msgid ""
"# 顶层 BLOB\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\"blob_table\")\n"
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(read_session.splits[0])\n"
"blob_manager = client.open_blob_manager(\"blob_table\")\n"
"\n"
"for record in reader.get_as_record_reader():\n"
"    ref = record[1]              # bytes —— blob 引用\n"
"    data = next(blob_manager.read_blobs([ref])).data\n"
"    print(record[0], len(data))  # a, len(b)\n"
"\n"
"# 嵌套 ARRAY<BLOB>\n"
"read_session = client_v3.create_table_read_session(\"nested_blob_table\")"
"\n"
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(read_session.splits[0])\n"
"blob_manager = client_v3.open_blob_manager(\"nested_blob_table\")\n"
"\n"
"for record in reader.get_as_record_reader():\n"
"    ref_list = record[1]         # list[bytes] —— 引用列表\n"
"    blobs = [b.data for b in blob_manager.read_blobs(ref_list)]\n"
"    print(record[0], [len(b) for b in blobs])"
msgstr ""
"# Top-level BLOB\n"
"read_session = client.create_table_read_session(\"blob_table\")\n"
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(read_session.splits[0])\n"
"blob_manager = client.open_blob_manager(\"blob_table\")\n"
"\n"
"for record in reader.get_as_record_reader():\n"
"    ref = record[1]              # bytes — blob reference\n"
"    data = next(blob_manager.read_blobs([ref])).data\n"
"    print(record[0], len(data))  # a, len(b)\n"
"\n"
"# Nested ARRAY<BLOB>\n"
"read_session = client_v3.create_table_read_session(\"nested_blob_table\")"
"\n"
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(read_session.splits[0])\n"
"blob_manager = client_v3.open_blob_manager(\"nested_blob_table\")\n"
"\n"
"for record in reader.get_as_record_reader():\n"
"    ref_list = record[1]         # list[bytes] — list of references\n"
"    blobs = [b.data for b in blob_manager.read_blobs(ref_list)]\n"
"    print(record[0], [len(b) for b in blobs])"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:811
msgid "嵌套 Blob"
msgstr "Nested blobs"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:813
msgid ""
"当 BLOB 列嵌套在复杂类型（ARRAY、STRUCT、MAP）中时，需要通过 ``find_all_"
"blob_column_ids()`` 解析出嵌套列的服务端列 ID（dot-path 形式如 ``b."
"element``）。 该特性仅支持 API 版本 3 及以上（创建客户端时指定 ``api_"
"version=\"3\"``）。"
msgstr ""
"When a BLOB column is nested inside a complex type (ARRAY, STRUCT, MAP), "
"use ``find_all_blob_column_ids()`` to resolve the server-assigned column "
"ID for the nested column (as a dot-path such as ``b.element``). This "
"feature requires API version 3 or above (specify ``api_version=\"3\"`` "
"when creating the client)."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:817
msgid "BLOB 列在 Python / Arrow 中的表示取决于所在复杂类型。下表列出常见组合："
msgstr ""
"The Python / Arrow representation of a BLOB column depends on the complex"
" type that contains it. The table below lists common combinations:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:832
msgid ""
"dot-path 中 ``.element`` 表示 ARRAY 的元素层，``.value`` 表示 MAP 的值层"
"， ``.<field_name>`` 表示 STRUCT 的字段层。多层嵌套时按从外到内的顺序拼接"
"。"
msgstr ""
"In a dot-path, ``.element`` denotes the ARRAY element level, ``.value`` "
"the MAP value level, and ``.<field_name>`` the STRUCT field level. For "
"multi-level nesting, segments are concatenated from outermost to "
"innermost."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:836
msgid "ARRAY<BLOB> 示例"
msgstr "ARRAY<BLOB> example"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:838
msgid ""
"表结构：``a BIGINT, b ARRAY<BLOB>``。列 ``b`` 的每个元素是一个独立的 Blob"
"。"
msgstr ""
"Table schema: ``a BIGINT, b ARRAY<BLOB>``. Each element of column ``b`` "
"is an independent Blob."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:840
msgid "**手动上传**（先批量上传，再将引用写入 Arrow）："
msgstr "**Manual upload** (batch-upload first, then write refs into Arrow):"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:842
msgid ""
"client_v3 = MaxStorageClient(odps, api_version=\"3\")\n"
"write_session = "
"client_v3.create_table_write_session(\"nested_blob_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\")\n"
"\n"
"# 嵌套列名：array<blob> 列 b → \"b.element\"\n"
"# 批量上传两行各 2~3 个 blob（resp.blob_references 已是 list[bytes]）\n"
"items = [\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"row0_blob0\", "
"column_name=\"b.element\"),\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"row0_blob1\", "
"column_name=\"b.element\"),\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"row1_blob0\", "
"column_name=\"b.element\"),\n"
"]\n"
"resp = writer.write_blob_batch(items)\n"
"refs = resp.blob_references  # list[bytes]\n"
"\n"
"# 将引用按行组织成 list[bytes]，写入 Arrow list(binary) 列\n"
"row_refs = [refs[0:2], refs[2:3]]\n"
"batch = pa.RecordBatch.from_arrays(\n"
"    [pa.array([0, 1], pa.int64()), pa.array(row_refs, "
"pa.list_(pa.binary()))],\n"
"    schema=pa.schema([(\"a\", pa.int64()), (\"b\", "
"pa.list_(pa.binary()))]),\n"
")\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"
msgstr ""
"client_v3 = MaxStorageClient(odps, api_version=\"3\")\n"
"write_session = "
"client_v3.create_table_write_session(\"nested_blob_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\")\n"
"\n"
"# Nested column name: column b of type array<blob> → \"b.element\"\n"
"# Batch-upload 2~3 blobs for two rows (resp.blob_references is already "
"list[bytes])\n"
"items = [\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"row0_blob0\", "
"column_name=\"b.element\"),\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"row0_blob1\", "
"column_name=\"b.element\"),\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"row1_blob0\", "
"column_name=\"b.element\"),\n"
"]\n"
"resp = writer.write_blob_batch(items)\n"
"refs = resp.blob_references  # list[bytes]\n"
"\n"
"# Organize refs into list[bytes] per row, write into Arrow list(binary)\n"
"row_refs = [refs[0:2], refs[2:3]]\n"
"batch = pa.RecordBatch.from_arrays(\n"
"    [pa.array([0, 1], pa.int64()), pa.array(row_refs, "
"pa.list_(pa.binary()))],\n"
"    schema=pa.schema([(\"a\", pa.int64()), (\"b\", "
"pa.list_(pa.binary()))]),\n"
")\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:868
msgid "读取时，``b`` 列返回 ``list[bytes]``（每个元素是一个引用），逐个下载即可："
msgstr ""
"On read, column ``b`` returns ``list[bytes]`` (each element is a "
"reference); download them individually:"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:870
msgid ""
"read_session = client_v3.create_table_read_session(\"nested_blob_table\")"
"\n"
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(read_session.splits[0])\n"
"blob_manager = client_v3.open_blob_manager(\"nested_blob_table\")\n"
"\n"
"for batch in reader:\n"
"    for a_val, blob_ref_list in zip(batch.column(0).to_pylist(),\n"
"                                    batch.column(1).to_pylist()):\n"
"        # blob_ref_list 是 list[bytes]（引用列表）\n"
"        blobs = [b.data for b in blob_manager.read_blobs(blob_ref_list)]\n"
"        print(a_val, [len(b) for b in blobs])"
msgstr ""
"read_session = client_v3.create_table_read_session(\"nested_blob_table\")"
"\n"
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(read_session.splits[0])\n"
"blob_manager = client_v3.open_blob_manager(\"nested_blob_table\")\n"
"\n"
"for batch in reader:\n"
"    for a_val, blob_ref_list in zip(batch.column(0).to_pylist(),\n"
"                                    batch.column(1).to_pylist()):\n"
"        # blob_ref_list is list[bytes] (a list of references)\n"
"        blobs = [b.data for b in blob_manager.read_blobs(blob_ref_list)]\n"
"        print(a_val, [len(b) for b in blobs])"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:884
msgid "STRUCT<f: BLOB> 示例"
msgstr "STRUCT<f: BLOB> example"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:886
