"表结构：``id BIGINT, s STRUCT<f: BLOB>``。列 ``s`` 是一个结构体，字段 ``f"
"`` 是 Blob。"
msgstr ""
"Table schema: ``id BIGINT, s STRUCT<f: BLOB>``. Column ``s`` is a struct "
"whose field ``f`` is a Blob."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:888
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"items = [writer.build_blob_write_item(b\"struct_blob_0\", "
"column_name=\"s.f\")]\n"
