#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:918
msgid "Blob 元数据"
msgstr "Blob metadata"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:920
msgid ""
"每个 Blob 可携带两条元数据：**MIME 类型**（``mime_type``）和**自定义"
"文件名** （``custom_file_name``，仅 API v3）。写入时通过 ``BlobWriteItem`"
"` 设置， 读取时从 ``BlobRecord`` / ``BlobStreamReader`` 取回。"
msgstr ""
"Each blob can carry two pieces of metadata: **MIME type** (``mime_type``)"
" and **custom file name** (``custom_file_name``, API v3 only). Set them "
"on ``BlobWriteItem`` at upload time; retrieve them from ``BlobRecord`` / "
"``BlobStreamReader`` at download time."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:924
msgid ""
"完整流程：上传带元数据的 Blob → 写入引用 → 读取引用 → 下载并验证元数据"
"。"
msgstr ""
"Full pipeline: upload blobs with metadata → write references → read "
"references → download and verify metadata."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:926
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient\n"
"\n"
"client_v3 = MaxStorageClient(odps, api_version=\"3\")\n"
"\n"
"# --- 写入：上传带元数据的 Blob ---\n"
"write_session = client_v3.create_table_write_session(\"blob_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\")\n"
"\n"
"items = [\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(\n"
"        b\"\\x89PNG image data\",\n"
"        column_name=\"b\",\n"
"        mime_type=\"image/png\",\n"
"        custom_file_name=\"photo.png\",\n"
"    ),\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(\n"
"        b'{\"key\": \"value\"}',\n"
"        column_name=\"b\",\n"
"        mime_type=\"application/json\",\n"
"        custom_file_name=\"config.json\",\n"
"    ),\n"
"]\n"
"resp = writer.write_blob_batch(items)\n"
"refs = resp.blob_references  # list[bytes]\n"
"\n"
"# 将引用写入 Arrow 批次\n"
"batch = pa.RecordBatch.from_arrays(\n"
"    [pa.array([0, 1], pa.int64()), pa.array(refs, pa.binary())],\n"
"    schema=pa.schema([(\"a\", pa.int64()), (\"b\", pa.binary())]),\n"
")\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()\n"
"\n"
"# --- 读取：下载 Blob 并取回元数据 ---\n"
"read_session = client_v3.create_table_read_session(\"blob_table\")\n"
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(read_session.splits[0])\n"
"blob_manager = client_v3.open_blob_manager(\"blob_table\")\n"
"\n"
"for batch in reader:\n"
"    for a_val, ref in zip(batch.column(0).to_pylist(),\n"
"                          batch.column(1).to_pylist()):\n"
"        # 方式一：BlobRecord（一次性读取，含元数据）\n"
"        record = next(blob_manager.read_blobs([ref]))\n"
"        print(record.data)              # bytes —— 原始内容\n"
"        print(record.mime_type)         # \"image/png\" / "
"\"application/json\"\n"
"        print(record.custom_file_name)  # \"photo.png\" / \"config.json\""
"\n"
"\n"
"        # 方式二：BlobStreamReader（流式读取，含元数据）\n"
"        stream_reader = blob_manager.read_blobs([ref], stream=True)\n"
"        print(stream_reader.mime_type)        # 元数据在读取前即可获取\n"
"        print(stream_reader.custom_file_name)\n"
"        while True:\n"
"            chunk = stream_reader.read(4096)\n"
"            if not chunk:\n"
"                break\n"
"            # 处理 chunk\n"
"        stream_reader.next()  # 前进到下一个 Blob（若有）"
msgstr ""
"from odps.maxstorage import MaxStorageClient\n"
"\n"
"client_v3 = MaxStorageClient(odps, api_version=\"3\")\n"
"\n"
"# --- Write: upload blobs with metadata ---\n"
"write_session = client_v3.create_table_write_session(\"blob_table\")\n"
"writer = write_session.open_arrow_writer(stream_id=\"0\")\n"
"\n"
"items = [\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(\n"
"        b\"\\x89PNG image data\",\n"
"        column_name=\"b\",\n"
"        mime_type=\"image/png\",\n"
"        custom_file_name=\"photo.png\",\n"
"    ),\n"
"    writer.build_blob_write_item(\n"
"        b'{\"key\": \"value\"}',\n"
"        column_name=\"b\",\n"
"        mime_type=\"application/json\",\n"
"        custom_file_name=\"config.json\",\n"
"    ),\n"
"]\n"
"resp = writer.write_blob_batch(items)\n"
"refs = resp.blob_references  # list[bytes]\n"
"\n"
"# Write references into an Arrow batch\n"
"batch = pa.RecordBatch.from_arrays(\n"
"    [pa.array([0, 1], pa.int64()), pa.array(refs, pa.binary())],\n"
"    schema=pa.schema([(\"a\", pa.int64()), (\"b\", pa.binary())]),\n"
")\n"
"writer.write_batch(batch)\n"
"writer.close()\n"
"write_session.commit()\n"
"\n"
"# --- Read: download blobs and retrieve metadata ---\n"
"read_session = client_v3.create_table_read_session(\"blob_table\")\n"
"reader = read_session.open_arrow_reader(read_session.splits[0])\n"
"blob_manager = client_v3.open_blob_manager(\"blob_table\")\n"
"\n"
"for batch in reader:\n"
"    for a_val, ref in zip(batch.column(0).to_pylist(),\n"
"                          batch.column(1).to_pylist()):\n"
"        # Option 1: BlobRecord (one-shot read, includes metadata)\n"
"        record = next(blob_manager.read_blobs([ref]))\n"
"        print(record.data)              # bytes — raw content\n"
"        print(record.mime_type)         # \"image/png\" / "
"\"application/json\"\n"
"        print(record.custom_file_name)  # \"photo.png\" / \"config.json\""
"\n"
"\n"
"        # Option 2: BlobStreamReader (streaming read, includes metadata)\n"
"        stream_reader = blob_manager.read_blobs([ref], stream=True)\n"
"        print(stream_reader.mime_type)        # metadata available before"
" reading\n"
"        print(stream_reader.custom_file_name)\n"
"        while True:\n"
"            chunk = stream_reader.read(4096)\n"
"            if not chunk:\n"
"                break\n"
"            # process chunk\n"
"        stream_reader.next()  # advance to the next blob (if any)"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:989
msgid ""
"``custom_file_name`` 仅在 API v3 及以上可用；v2 客户端上传时该字段被静默 "
"忽略，下载时 ``BlobRecord.custom_file_name`` 始终为 ``None``。 ``mime_"
"type`` 在 v2 / v3 均可用。"
msgstr ""
"``custom_file_name`` is only available on API v3 and above; on v2 clients"
" the field is silently ignored at upload time, and "
"``BlobRecord.custom_file_name`` is always ``None`` at download time. "
"``mime_type`` works on both v2 and v3."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:995
msgid "逐 Blob 元数据回调"
msgstr "Per-blob metadata callback"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:997
msgid ""
"上面的 \"手动上传\" 需要手动调用 ``write_blob_batch`` 上传 Blob 并在 ``"
"BlobWriteItem`` 上逐个设置元数据。而在**自动上传模式**下（即直接把 BLOB "
"原始 数据放入 Arrow 批次 ``write_batch``，或通过 Record API ``rw.write()`"
"` 写入）， writer 自动批量上传每个 BLOB 单元格。此时可通过 ``blob_"
"metadata_callback`` 回调为**每一个 BLOB 单元格单独指定** ``mime_type`` 和"
" ``custom_file_name``。"
msgstr ""
"The \"manual upload\" above requires manually calling "
"``write_blob_batch`` and setting metadata on each ``BlobWriteItem``. In "
"**auto-upload mode** (putting raw BLOB data directly into an Arrow batch "
"via ``write_batch``, or writing via the Record API ``rw.write()``), the "
"writer auto-uploads each BLOB cell in batch. Use the "
"``blob_metadata_callback`` to assign ``mime_type`` and "
"``custom_file_name`` **individually for every BLOB cell**."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:1003
msgid ""
"回调签名：``callback(row_index, column_name, blob_data) -> (mime_type, "
"custom_file_name) | None``"
msgstr ""
"Signature: ``callback(row_index, column_name, blob_data) -> (mime_type, "
"custom_file_name) | None``"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:1005
msgid "``row_index``：当前行索引（从 0 开始）。"
msgstr "``row_index``: Zero-based current row index."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:1006
msgid ""
"``column_name``：BLOB 列的 dot-path（顶层列为列名如 ``\"b\"``，嵌套列为 `"
"`\"b.element\"``、``\"s.f\"``）。"
msgstr ""
"``column_name``: Dot-path of the BLOB column (top-level columns use the "
"column name e.g. ``\"b\"``; nested columns use ``\"b.element\"``, "
"``\"s.f\"``)."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:1007
msgid ""
"``blob_data``：原始 BLOB 数据。Record API 路径下为用户传入的原始值（``"
"bytes`` / 文件对象）， 回调在文件被读取为 bytes 之前触发；Arrow API 路径"
"下为已反序列化的 ``bytes``。"
msgstr ""
"``blob_data``: The original BLOB data. In the Record API path this is the"
" original value the user passed (``bytes`` / file-like object); the "
"callback fires before the file is read into bytes. In the Arrow API path "
"this is the deserialized ``bytes``."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:1012
msgid "回调**对每个 BLOB 单元格恰好调用一次**。"
msgstr "The callback is **invoked exactly once per BLOB cell**."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:1013
msgid "``None`` 值和已有的 blob 引用（``str``）不会触发回调——它们不会被上传。"
msgstr ""
"``None`` values and existing blob references (``str``) do not trigger the"
" callback — they are never uploaded."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:1014
msgid ""
"回调返回 ``None`` 时，回退到 ``open_arrow_writer`` 传入的 ``blob_mime_"
"type`` / ``blob_custom_file_name`` 会话级默认值（也可单独使用，无需回调）"
"；若默认值也为 ``None``，则该 Blob 不携带元数据。"
msgstr ""
"When the callback returns ``None``, it falls back to the session-level "
"defaults (``blob_mime_type`` / ``blob_custom_file_name`` passed to "
"``open_arrow_writer``, which can also be used on their own without a "
"callback); if those are also ``None``, the blob carries no metadata."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:1017
msgid ""
"流式上传（``write_blob_stream``）的 wire 协议不包含 framing header， 因此"
"流式路径**不支持**元数据。"
msgstr ""
"Stream uploads (``write_blob_stream``) use a wire protocol with no "
"framing header, so the streaming path **does not support** metadata."

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:1020
msgid "示例（从文件名推导 ``custom_file_name``）："
msgstr "Example (inferring ``custom_file_name`` from the file name):"

#: ../../source/base-maxstorage.rst:1022
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"import os\n"
"from odps.models import Record\n"
"\n"
"write_session = client.create_table_write_session(\"blob_table\")\n"
"\n"
"def metadata_fn(row_index, column_name, blob_data):\n"
"    # blob_data 是用户传入的原始文件对象，可用其 .name 推导文件名\n"
"    name = os.path.basename(getattr(blob_data, \"name\", "
"f\"blob_{row_index}\"))\n"
"    return None, name\n"
"\n"
